<BaseLayout title="A whole scene. One place. — About LiveDiscover"><section class="container page-section simple-page"><div class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Independent by nature. Local by heart.</p><h1>For the love<br/><i>of being there.</i></h1><p>Some nights stay with you. The song you didn’t know you needed.<br/>The room full of strangers singing the same words.<br/>We’re here to help you find a few more of them.</p></div><div class="prose"><h2>A whole scene. <i>One place.</i></h2><p>LiveDiscover is a concept for an independent guide to live music across Raleigh, Durham, Chapel Hill, Carrboro, and Cary. A place to see what’s coming up, follow an artist’s next chapter, and find a room you’ve never stepped inside.</p><p>We believe discovering a great show should feel as good as going to one. Fewer tabs. Clear details. A little context. A straight path from “that sounds good” to a night on your calendar.</p><h2 id="how-it-works">How it <i>works.</i></h2><ol><li><strong>Find your sound.</strong> Search for an artist, venue, or city. Filter by date, genre, and price until something catches your ear.</li><li><strong>Keep a little setlist.</strong> Save shows and follow artists. Everything stays in your browser, with no account to create.</li><li><strong>Make a night of it.</strong> Open a show for the details, find the room, and add it to your calendar.</li><li><strong>Share your own show.</strong> Artists, venues, agents, and promoters can prepare an event draft through the submission form.</li></ol><h2>A note about <i>this demo.</i></h2><p>This website is populated with original fictional artists, tours, concerts, and artwork. The Foundry Hall is an imagined venue. Listings for existing venues are illustrative and do not advertise actual performances. No live tickets are sold, and no real reservations are made.</p><p>The forms demonstrate validation and local draft storage. Newsletter delivery, editorial review, and live reservations become available only after the required services are connected.</p><a class="button button-ghost" href="/events">Find a little inspiration <Icon name="right" size={17}/></a></div></section><SubmitBand/></BaseLayout>
